g:p004","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m009-0008","start":8,"end":11,"surface":"季平子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002833","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p009","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m009-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"平子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002833","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p009","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m009-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"平子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002833","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p009","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m011-0027","start":27,"end":30,"surface":"季平子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002833","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p011","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji047-011","person_id":"cbr-p002833","surfaces":["季平子","平子"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-047-kong"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p004","quote":"孔子年十七，魯大夫孟釐子病且死，誡其嗣懿子曰：「孔丘，聖人之後，滅於宋。其祖弗父何始有宋而嗣讓厲公。及正考父佐戴、武、宣公，三命茲益恭，故鼎銘云：『一命而僂，再命而傴，三命而俯，循牆而走，亦莫敢余侮。饘於是，粥於是，以餬余口。』其恭如是。吾聞聖人之後，雖不當世，必有達者。今孔丘年少好禮，其達者歟？吾即沒，若必師之。」及釐子卒，懿子與魯人南宮敬叔往學禮焉。是歲，季武子卒，平子代立。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p009","quote":"孔子年三十五，而季平子與郈昭伯以鬬雞故得罪魯昭公，昭公率師擊平子，平子與孟氏、叔孫氏三家共攻昭公，昭公師敗，奔於齊，齊處昭公乾侯。其後頃之，魯亂。孔子適齊，為高昭子家臣，欲以通乎景公。與齊太師語樂，聞韶音，學之，三月不知肉味，齊人稱之。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p011","quote":"孔子年四十二，魯昭公卒於乾侯，定公立。定公立五年，夏，季平子卒，桓子嗣立。季桓子穿井得土缶，中若羊，問仲尼云「得狗」。仲尼曰：「以丘所聞，羊也。丘聞之，木石之怪夔、罔閬，水之怪龍、罔象，土之怪墳羊。」"}],"rationale":"限本篇明示名、字、對話自稱、世系及附贊局部對應；世系求與冉求分開，武不接漢武帝，今皇帝與高皇帝不補姓名。子路仲由明示同指另存，冉有冉求與秦繆秦穆仍待核；附贊不當獨立作者正文或獨立見證。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p004","text":"孔子年十七，魯大夫孟釐子病且死，誡其嗣懿子曰：「孔丘，聖人之後，滅於宋。其祖弗父何始有宋而嗣讓厲公。及正考父佐戴、武、宣公，三命茲益恭，故鼎銘云：『一命而僂，再命而傴，三命而俯，循牆而走，亦莫敢余侮。饘於是，粥於是，以餬余口。』其恭如是。吾聞聖人之後，雖不當世，必有達者。今孔丘年少好禮，其達者歟？吾即沒，若必師之。」及釐子卒，懿子與魯人南宮敬叔往學禮焉。是歲，季武子卒，平子代立。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m004-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002851","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m004-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"孟釐子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002828","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m004-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"懿子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002854","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m004-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"孔丘","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002851","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m004-0027","start":27,"end":31,"surface":"聖人之後","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"宗族、群體、神怪、官稱或說話對象未定，不補成員姓名及親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m004-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"其祖","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"宗族、群體、神怪、官稱或說話對象未定，不補成員姓名及親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m004-0038","start":38,"end":41,"surface":"弗父何","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002829","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m004-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"厲公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002855","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m004-0051","start":51,"end":54,"surface":"正考父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002830","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m004-0055","start":55,"end":56,"surface":"戴","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002869","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m004-0057","start":57,"end":58,"surface":"武","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002870","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m004-0059","start":59,"en